acSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌发布新版 NotebookLM：全面升级 Gemini 1.5 Flash 并引入独立云端计算机与 AI 代理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">小米MiMo技术团队发布AI编程辅助工具MiMo Code并正式开源</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与甲骨文达成战略合作，OCI用户可直接调用OpenAI模型</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌联手Warby Parker与Gentle Monster推出Gemini智能眼镜</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/496584ac3bb20f988063d85a4d373699.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式宣布与Warby Parker及Gentle Monster合作研发的智能眼镜将于今年秋季上市。该产品由Gemini大模型驱动，采用无屏设计，通过集成摄像头、麦克风和扬声器，利用蓝牙连接安卓手机实现音频与感知交互。核心优势在于Gemini与安卓生态的深度耦合，支持代理操作，用户可通过语音指令指挥手机完成点餐或叫车等任务。此外，该眼镜支持与Wear OS智能手表联动，实现拍摄照片缩略图的即时推送。谷歌此举旨在通过系统级生态整合，在智能眼镜市场对垒Meta与雷朋的合作产品。尽管谷歌采取了去屏幕化的保守硬件策略，但其AI大模型能力与安卓生态的联动，或将为行业竞争开辟差异化路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌联合英伟达发布开源模型DiffusionGemma，引入扩散机制实现单卡推理提速4倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dd8809b02ed43d178f588e32b86ed7dc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于2026年6月10日发布实验性开源模型DiffusionGemma，首次将扩散机制引入文本生成领域，打破传统自回归生成范式。该模型采用260亿参数的MoE架构，单步激活参数为38亿。通过英伟达深度优化，模型在H100显卡上处理单条请求速度达1000 tokens/s，在RTX5090上突破700 tokens/s，单卡推理速度较传统模型提升近4倍。DiffusionGemma支持一次性并行输出256个标记，具备“全块感知”能力，在文本后补、代码填空及结构化数据处理任务中表现优异。目前，模型权重已基于Apache 2.0协议在Hugging Face开源，并全面兼容vLLM与MLX推理框架。该技术路径通过并行化处理有效缓解了内存带宽对GPU算力的制约，为非线性文本生成任务提供了全新的解决方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布新版 NotebookLM：全面升级 Gemini 1.5 Flash 并引入独立云端计算机与 AI 代理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f1e8cf8ce399c58eb2189d60afeb703.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于2026年6月10日宣布NotebookLM重大升级，系统正式接入Gemini 1.5 Flash模型，并深度整合内部编码工具Antigravity。此次更新为每个用户笔记本配置了独立云端计算机，支持代码编写与实时执行，并引入AI Agent架构以处理复杂学术与工程项目。内部测试显示，新架构在约65%的评估场景中表现优于旧版。功能方面，新增“零源（Zero-source）”检索选项，支持通过Google搜索动态获取全网资源并自动标注；分析报告现可一键导出为PDF、Excel、PPT及图像文件。该更新已面向全球Google AI Ultra用户及Workspace企业用户开放。此次演进标志着NotebookLM从文本摘要器向具备主动执行力的端到端科研助手转型，通过整合代码执行环境与互联网搜索，进一步提升了基</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米MiMo技术团队发布AI编程辅助工具MiMo Code并正式开源</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f58bf6d430c1f9a77228c4b71ce645c6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">小米旗下MiMo技术团队于6月11日正式开源AI编程辅助工具MiMo Code，该工具基于OpenCode技术底座开发，采用MIT开源协议。MiMo Code引入了持久记忆系统与无限上下文处理能力，支持模型Agent协同优化，并内置独创的Compose模式以简化复杂编程任务。在生态兼容性上，该工具支持接入DeepSeek、Kimi及GLM等主流大模型，开发者可根据项目需求自主选择适配模型。此外，工具内置了限时免费的多模态模型MiMo V2.5，旨在通过AI与代码的深度融合提升编码效率。此次开源不仅展示了小米在AI开发工具链的布局，也为开发者提供了具备高自主性与扩展性的编程辅助方案，进一步推动了国产AI编程生态的建设。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与甲骨文达成战略合作，OCI用户可直接调用OpenAI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与甲骨文于6月10日正式宣布达成战略合作，旨在通过深度整合算力生态，提升AI模型在云端的调用便捷性。此次合作的核心在于打通OpenAI模型与甲骨文云基础设施（OCI）的协同通道，预计在未来几周内落地。OCI客户将无需经过额外的新增采购审批，直接利用现有的甲骨文云承诺额度（UCM积分），即可实现对OpenAI前沿模型及Codex系统的访问。这一“开箱即用”的调用模式显著降低了企业部署尖端AI能力的技术门槛，使企业能够更高效地利用既有云资源加速智能化转型。通过将OpenAI模型能力深度嵌入OCI服务生态，双方不仅提升了资源利用效率，也为后续更多元化的企业级AI解决方案落地奠定了基础，标志着算力云厂商与顶尖AI技术提供商的合作进一步深化。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
